@base = http://localhost:8080

# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@pigz.com", "password": "admin123"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Veículos disponíveis com comparação FIPE
GET {{base}}/api/vehicles?sort=price_asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Comparação detalhada com histórico
GET {{base}}/api/vehicles/1/fipe-comparison
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cadastrar modelo FIPE (admin)
POST {{base}}/api/fipe/models
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fipe_code": "004403-4", "vehicle_type": "carro", "brand": "Fiat", "model": "Argo Drive 1.0", "model_year": 2023, "fuel": "Flex"}

### Adicionar mês ao histórico (admin)
POST {{base}}/api/fipe/models/4/prices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reference_month": "2026-11", "price": 71500.00}

### Anunciar veículo vinculado à FIPE (admin)
POST {{base}}/api/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fipe_model_id": 4, "brand": "Fiat", "model": "Argo", "version": "Drive 1.0", "body_type": "hatch", "manufacture_year": 2022, "model_year": 2023, "fuel": "Flex", "transmission": "manual", "mileage": 25000, "doors": 4, "features": ["multimídia"], "city": "Curitiba", "state": "PR", "price": 68900, "status": "available"}

### Criar usuário comum (admin)
POST {{base}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Maria", "email": "maria@pigz.com", "password": "senha1234"}